{"id":"f7b3c70dde0fbf32","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-primes-and-composites-in-np.md","title":"素数与合数的非确定性多项式验证","display":"thm-primes-and-composites-in-np — 素数与合数的非确定性多项式验证","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-primes-and-composites-in-np","aliases":["73-thm-primes-and-composites-in-np"],"display":"thm-primes-and-composites-in-np — 素数与合数的非确定性多项式验证","depends_on":["[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size]]","[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]","[[73-df-binary-np]]","[[73-df-binary-co-np]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.5, Theorems 11.25–11.26, print pp. 518–521; PDF pp. 540–543","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-primes-and-composites-in-np"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-primes-and-composites-in-np</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-primes-and-composites-in-np — 素数与合数的非确定性多项式验证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfebf3d79d57531c\" href=\"?note=cfebf3d79d57531c\" title=\"73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size\">73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"498d8afd65d4a6ee\" href=\"?note=498d8afd65d4a6ee\" title=\"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages\">73-df-primes-and-composites-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1fa0c4e009de5637\" href=\"?note=1fa0c4e009de5637\" title=\"73-df-binary-co-np\">73-df-binary-co-np</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.5, Theorems 11.25–11.26, print pp. 518–521; PDF pp. 540–543"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE},\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE},\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\)</span> 取规范输入与非法码约定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP},\\mathsf{coNP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP},\\mathsf{coNP}\\)</span> 为本册二进制类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE},\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\cap\\mathsf{coNP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE},\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\cap\\mathsf{coNP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>素数用多项式长度 Pratt 证书；合数猜一个真因子并做二进制除法。NONPRIME 对非法码及 0、1 立即接受，否则走合数验证。补 PRIME 就是 NONPRIME；补 COMPOSITE 为 PRIME 加同一组可判定边界输入，因此两者都在 coNP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size","status":"resolved","id":"cfebf3d79d57531c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages","status":"resolved","id":"498d8afd65d4a6ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-co-np","status":"resolved","id":"1fa0c4e009de5637","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-co-np]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE},\\mathsf{NONPRIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NP},\\mathsf{coNP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE},\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\cap\\mathsf{coNP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1441,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-primes-and-composites-in-np|素数与合数的非确定性多项式验证]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["cfebf3d79d57531c","498d8afd65d4a6ee","ebe5483ba604bc90","1fa0c4e009de5637"]}